M11 Sydney rally zones re-check a player who is already inside.
M11_Sydney_Rally_Zone_01/02/03/03b_JDG send Sydney on only when STAR enters
after Sydney's arrival custom set sydneyInPosition. If the player was already
standing in the zone when she arrived, nothing happened until they stepped
out and back in.

Track STAR presence with Entered/Exited (saved id 2). When Sydney's arrival
custom finds the player inside, start a 0.5 s timer that runs the original
Entered branch for STAR if the player is still inside. A saved one-shot flag
(id 3) makes the branch run once whichever way it is reached. Entering after
Sydney arrives behaves as before.

diff --git a/Mission11.cpp b/Mission11.cpp
--- a/Mission11.cpp
+++ b/Mission11.cpp
@@ -9146,15 +9146,24 @@
